<title>USA: US banks free rsrvs $899 mln/day Mar 26 rvd 2 wks.</title>
<headline>US banks free rsrvs $899 mln/day Mar 26 rvd 2 wks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. commercial banks had revised free reserves of $899 million per day in the two weeks ended March 26, versus revised free reserves of $1,203 million in the previous two-week period, the Federal Reserve said.</p>
<p>Seasonal borrowings were $38 million versus $27 million a day. Extended credits were nil.</p>
<p>((-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
</text>
